Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 2

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P002

Summary: MK7-specific read-only telemetry experiment

Description: |
    Retains P001 status display and enables optional read-only
    observations of lap progress, checkpoint, position and speed.
    Memory layout is derived from Citra and unverified on 3DS.
    No game memory changes, controls, learning, or file writing.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
